<% if (_status === 'canceled') { %>
Subscription Canceled
======================

Hi <%= adminName %>,

Your <%= planName %> subscription has been canceled.
<% if (endDate) { %>Your access will remain active until <%= endDate %>.
<% } else { %>Your account has been set to inactive.
<% } %>

DETAILS
-------
Plan:        <%= planName %>
Status:      <%= endDate ? 'Canceling at period end' : 'Inactive' %>
<% if (endDate) { %>Active Until: <%= endDate %>
<% } %><% if (canceledAt) { %>Canceled On: <%= canceledAt %>
<% } %>

If this was done in error, you can reactivate your subscription from the account settings before your current billing period ends.
<% } else if (_status === 'updated') { %>
Subscription Updated
=====================

Hi <%= adminName %>,

Your subscription has been updated. Here are the details:

DETAILS
-------
Plan:   <%= planName %>
Status: <%= status || 'Active' %>
<% if (additionalSeats !== undefined) { %>Additional Seats: <%= additionalSeats %>
<% } %><% if (endDate) { %>Next Billing Date: <%= endDate %>
<% } %>

You can review your subscription details in your account settings.
<% } %>
